sgstraining3D.fpp:  Build at DNS resolution. Computes ML SGS training 
data for Boussinesq flows, allowing user to specifiy truncation dimenstions.
Also computes the terms < N(u,u) > and <N(u,th)>, which form one summand 
for the SGS terms.

sglabels3D.fpp:  Build at tuncated resolution. Computes the final SGS
terms: 
      SGSi = <N>_i(<u>,<u>) - <N_i(u,u)> 
      SGSth = <N>_i(<u>,<u>) - <N_i(u,u)>

as well as the injection energy rates: Sum_i u_i SGS_i, and
th SGSth.

lesbouss3D: Do not use! Attempt to unify sgstrainingand sgslabels by
creating a truncation communicatory to compute the SGS terms. 
